	There are only a few ways to get intrinsic see invisible, that
I know of.

	1) It's one possible effect of quaffing at a fountain. Other 
possible effects are bad enough that this is not recommended, however.
	2) Quaff a *blessed* potion of see invisible. An uncursed
potion will give see invisible for a temporary period.
	3) Eat an invisible stalker corpse *when you are invisible
yourself*. If you're not invisible you simply turn invisible tempor-
arily (and may get intrinsic invisibility).
	4) Pray when your luck is high. Sometimes your god will reward
you with intrinsics.
	5) Play an Elf.

